# Open in VS Code and click "Send Request" (REST Client extension).
# Local run (dotnet run): http://localhost:5101   Through Traefik (later): http://localhost:8000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5101

### Health (includes a database check)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/health

### List customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers

### Only customers in one city
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers?city=Lahore

### One customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/1

### Not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/999

### Create a customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ayesha Malik",
  "email": "ayesha@lab.local",
  "city": "Multan"
}
